  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 99977c2b90e55dc43a710eadde53b7a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characters:
  - {fileID: 109005640}
  - {fileID: 2019751658}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 187998588}
  descriptions:
  - "Stivs ir le\u0123end\u0101rs piedz\u012Bvojumu mekl\u0113t\u0101js un vispus\u012Bgs
    meistars. Vi\u0146am piem\u012Bt neticams sp\u0113ks un iztur\u012Bba, kas \u013Cauj
    celt varenas pils\u0113tas un pieveikt pat Enderas p\u016B\u0137i."
  - "Aleksa ir drosm\u012Bga un izdomas bag\u0101ta p\u0113tniece no Minecraft pasaules.
    Vi\u0146a ir paz\u012Bstama ar savu veikl\u012Bbu un prasmi izdz\u012Bvot pat
    visb\u012Bstam\u0101kaj\u0101s vid\u0113s. Kop\u0101 ar St\u012Bvu vi\u0146a
    b\u016Bv\u0113 sare\u017E\u0123\u012Btas konstrukcijas un c\u012Bn\u0101s pret
    briesmo\u0146iem, vienm\u0113r gatava jauniem piedz\u012Bvojumiem."
